meta {
  name: 21 Return To Sender
  seq: 21
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  POST /api/v1/Shipments/{id}/return-to-sender: RETURNED (with a reason) for every
  undelivered item, the original closed as ReturnedToSender, and a new linked return
  shipment (receiver -> sender) auto-routed back over the lanes.

  Uses the network from 18 Route Planning plus return lanes created here
  (Chiang Mai branch -> hub -> Lat Krabang -> Bangna), and the Bangkok customer from 19.
  Ends with a partial return: the refused item of the delivered shipment from 12 Shipments.
}
